Description: MAD Terminal - grade before you sign
 The terminal for MAD, the angry auditor of the agent economy.
 It grades agent registrations, payment authorizations, x402
 endpoints, and token launches against receipts - before you sign
 or pay. Every output talks back in MAD's voice, and every screen
 wears MAD's face, drawn from MAD's own avatar. Free doors first;
 the paid doors cost 0.01 USDC via x402 and this terminal never
 pays for you. Includes the MCP handoff for Claude, Codex and Grok.
